      "scene": "ancient_map",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "张骞出使西域，走了十三年，中间失踪的那些年到底发生了什么？",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act03",
      "name": "第 3 幕",
      "scene": "archive_vault",
      "camera": "static",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "地图上这段空白，比任何答案都更吓人。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act04",
      "name": "第 4 幕",
      "scene": "great_wall",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_b",
      "text": "考古现场只找到了半枚铜印，剩下的都被风沙埋了。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_b",
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act05",
      "name": "第 5 幕",
      "scene": "ancient_map",
      "camera": "push_in",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "今天，我们把这条线索重新拼起来。",
      "characters": [
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act06",
      "name": "第 6 幕",
      "scene": "archive_vault",
      "camera": "pan_right",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "host",
      "text": "这块残片上只有三个字，却把时间线往前推了四百年。",
      "characters": [
        "host",
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act07",
      "name": "第 7 幕",
      "scene": "great_wall",
      "camera": "static",
      "camera_strength": 0.06,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_a",
      "text": "我走过的那条路，风沙会把脚印抹掉，但抹不掉方向。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_a"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
    {
      "id": "act08",
      "name": "第 8 幕",
      "scene": "ancient_map",
      "camera": "dolly",
      "camera_strength": 0.1,
      "duration": 6.4,
      "line": "figure_b",
      "text": "而这正是记录的意义：让后来的人知道有人走过。",
      "characters": [
        "figure_b",
        "host"
      ],
      "broll": false
    },
